•Advance the permitting and design of the proposed Phase 2 Circuit REE expansion at the Mill to enable the total production (from the Phase 1 Circuit and Phase 2 Circuit) of up to 6,000 tonnes of separated NdPr, along with separated Dy, Tb and other REE materials, and seek to secure financing for the Phase 2 Circuit;

